            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.64

- Make Silk Stream float on a transparent background, without a box, border, or panel shadow.
- Add fine dark outlines and stronger green strands for visibility over light and dark content.
- Keep the existing microphone-reactive motion and Reduce Motion behavior unchanged.
]]></description>
