        <item>
            <title>0.6.62</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:59:43 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.62</link>
            <sparkle:version>95</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.62</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.62

- Replace the active-model numeric gauge with the Templeton-green silk waveform selected in the design preview.
- Use gentle flowing motion while ready and stronger motion during dictation processing or model loading. The Active label remains visible; this is not a microphone level meter.
- Respect Reduce Motion and pause model-indicator animation when hidden, detached, or the app is inactive.

This visual update does not resolve the separately reported sustained Zoom meeting performance issue.
]]></description>
