        <item>
            <title>0.6.61</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 23:20:05 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.61</link>
            <sparkle:version>94</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.61</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.61

- Align table headers with their column contents using consistent horizontal padding in History, Meetings, and other shared tables.
- Preserve native column dividers and header behavior, with readable labels in Light and Dark modes.
- Keep Refresh Checks directly below the guided-dictation card with consistent spacing, instead of below the taller neighboring card.

The reported sustained Zoom meeting performance issue remains under investigation; this update does not include a fix for it.
]]></description>
